3. **Modes of Subsistence- Hunter-Gatherers** (Sentinels), **Pastoralists** (Toda), **Shifting Cultivators** (Jhumias of Mizoram), **Settled Agriculturists** (Meenas of).

4. **Geographical Dispersion- arid deserts** of Rajasthan (Bhils), **high Himalayas** (Gaddis), **tropical rainforests** of the Andamans.

5. **Social Organization- Matrilineal societies** of Meghalaya (Khasis, Garos), **Patrilineal systems** of Central India.

6. **Religious Beliefs- Sarnaism** (nature worship), **Christianity** (Northeast), **Buddhism** (Ladakh), or **Hinduism** (Central India).

