- **A Cosmic Vision:** The framework of Indian culture places human beings at the center of the universe, as a divine creation-which celebrates Individuality and differences of opinion in the society. This helps members of Indian society to understand each other’s culture by keeping human life and well being at the center.
- **Principles of Tolerance and Respect:** Indian society has been founded upon these principles which result in mutual respect and understanding for each other. The mutual respect offered to diverse customs and identities has ensured that multiple cultures thrive in this great nation.
