**1. Leakages and corruption -**

a. Inclusion-exclusion errors in PDS **(Shanta Kumar committee)**

b. **Ghost beneficiaries in Ayushman Bharat** identified by CAG

2. **Lack of last mile reach** due to security issues like naxalism, insurgency etc.

**Poor Social Infrastructure**

1. **Healthcare** - low public spending (2.1% of GDP) and high out of pocket expenditure (40%)

2. **Education** - low public investment **(2.9% of GDP)** lead to “quality crisis” and high dropout rates at secondary and higher levels

3. **Skill Gap** - only about 51.25% of youth are employable.

