|** Approach: **<br>• Introduce the fast-food industry's growth amidst rising health concerns, focusing on India. <br>• Highlight factors driving growth: urbanization, busy lifestyles, marketing, affordability, and social trends. <br>• Address health issues like obesity and regulatory measures aimed at curbing unhealthy consumption. <br>• Conclude with the need for balanced policies promoting healthier food choices. |
