## **Following social issues need to be highlighted** ## **y Urban lounge** - Urban sprawl, or a real growth of the cities, both in population and geographical area, of rapidly growing cities is the leading cause of urban problems. In most cities, the **economic** **base is incompetent of dealing with the** **problems formulated by their excessive size.** - Massive immigration from rural areas and small towns to the big cities has taken place almost consistently, leading to the growing size of cities.

